CampusConnect: Unified Plan
A native Android app that puts timetables, official announcements, course materials and deadlines in one trusted place for students and lecturers in Tanzania.
1. Vision and scope
Problem. Announcements are scattered across WhatsApp groups, notice boards and word of mouth. Room changes are missed, notes are lost, and deadlines surprise people.
Promise. If it is in CampusConnect, it is official, current and works on a weak connection.
Who it serves
* Students: see what matters today, get alerts, download notes.
* Lecturers: publish once, reach exactly the right class.
* Administrators: control accounts, courses and quality.
Out of scope for the MVP: chat, payments, attendance, video classes, AI features, iOS. Add only after real demand.
